V7 toolchain — INSTALL
======================

Build the host-side cross-toolchain passes (a C99 compiler is required):

    make            # builds cc/host/c0/c0, cc/host/c1, as/as, ld/ld
    make check      # (see each subdir's check target)
    make install    # installs the host binaries under PREFIX (default /usr/local)

The pipeline:

    cc/host/c0/c0 src.c t1 t2     # parser: C source -> intermediate tree
    cc/host/c1 t1 t2 out.s        # code generator: tree -> PDP-11 assembly

For full instructions on the port, see README.md and PORTING.md.
